@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state "Create an account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / User not logged in
CreateAccount : do / Fill details
CreateAccount : exit / Registration successful

state "Watch videos" as WatchVideos
WatchVideos : entry / User logged in
WatchVideos : do / Select video to watch
WatchVideos : exit / Video watched

state "Upload videos" as UploadVideos
UploadVideos : entry / User logged in
UploadVideos : do / Upload new video
UploadVideos : exit / Video uploaded

state "Save videos" as SaveVideos
SaveVideos : entry / User watching a video
SaveVideos : do / Add to likes list
SaveVideos : exit / Saved successfully

state "View saved videos" as ViewSavedVideos
ViewSavedVideos : entry / User logged in
ViewSavedVideos : do / Display saved videos
ViewSavedVideos : exit / Videos viewed

state "Enter discussion option" as EnterDiscussion
EnterDiscussion : entry / User watching a video
EnterDiscussion : do / Select discussion option
EnterDiscussion : exit / Discussion entered

[*] --> CreateAccount

CreateAccount --> WatchVideos
WatchVideos --> UploadVideos
UploadVideos --> SaveVideos
SaveVideos --> ViewSavedVideos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion
EnterDiscussion --> [*]

@enduml
